{"seq":3,"slug":"nmr-saxs","title":"核磁共振与小角散射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/methods/nmr-saxs","wordCount":1565,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"核磁共振与小角散射\">核磁共振与小角散射</h1><p><a href=\"xray-crystallography\">晶体学</a>和<a href=\"cryo-em\">冷冻电镜</a>都给你一张「定格照」，可生命分子在溶液里是不停运动的。如果你想知道一个蛋白在水里到底有多柔、它在毫秒尺度上如何换构象、一个内在无序区到底采样了多大的构象空间——你需要在溶液中、在接近生理条件下做测量。核磁共振（NMR）和小角散射（SAXS/SANS）正是这样两类溶液方法：前者给原子级的局部信息与动态，后者给整体的低分辨形状。它们牺牲了高分辨，换来了别的方法给不了的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这两种方法在分辨率与信息维度上恰好互补。NMR 测的是溶液中原子核在磁场里的共振，能给出原子间距离约束、二面角与多时间尺度的动态；SAXS 测的是溶液对 X 射线的小角度散射，给出回旋半径、整体尺寸与低分辨分子包络。二者常与高分辨结构联用，做「混合/整合建模」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[溶液样品] --&gt; B[NMR&lt;br/&gt;磁场中核自旋共振]&#10;    A --&gt; C[SAXS/SANS&lt;br/&gt;小角度散射曲线]&#10;    B --&gt; D[NOE 距离约束&lt;br/&gt;化学位移/J 耦合]&#10;    B --&gt; E[弛豫数据&lt;br/&gt;ps-ns 与 us-ms 动态]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Guinier 区&lt;br/&gt;回旋半径 Rg]&#10;    C --&gt; G[配对距离分布&lt;br/&gt;低分辨包络]&#10;    D --&gt; H[结构系综计算]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I[整合建模]&#10;    G --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[溶液样品] --&gt; B[NMR&lt;br/&gt;磁场中核自旋共振]\n    A --&gt; C[SAXS/SANS&lt;br/&gt;小角度散射曲线]\n    B --&gt; D[NOE 距离约束&lt;br/&gt;化学位移/J 耦合]\n    B --&gt; E[弛豫数据&lt;br/&gt;ps-ns 与 us-ms 动态]\n    C --&gt; F[Guinier 区&lt;br/&gt;回旋半径 Rg]\n    C --&gt; G[配对距离分布&lt;br/&gt;低分辨包络]\n    D --&gt; H[结构系综计算]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I[整合建模]\n    G --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>NMR</th>\n<th>SAXS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信息</td>\n<td>原子级局部约束 + 动态</td>\n<td>整体形状与尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分子量上限</td>\n<td>约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kDa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\,\\text{kDa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kDa</span></span></span></span></span></span>（常规）</td>\n<td>几乎无上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>溶液、近生理</td>\n<td>溶液、近生理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独门强项</td>\n<td>多尺度动力学、无序区</td>\n<td>柔性系综、快速筛形状</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"nmr-在磁场里听原子说话\">NMR：在磁场里听原子说话</h2><p>把样品放进强磁场，特定原子核（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msup><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^1\\text{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>13</mn></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{13}\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{15}\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span>）的自旋会以与其化学环境相关的频率共振，这个频率偏移就是化学位移。多维 NMR 实验通过原子核之间的耦合把信号关联起来，逐一指认每个原子核。这套指认本身就是丰富的局部探针：化学位移对构象、质子化、结合事件都敏感。</p>\n<p>构建三维结构的关键约束来自核欧沃豪斯效应（NOE）——空间上靠近（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>A</mtext><mo>˚</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;5\\,\\text{Å}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.375em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˚</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）的两个质子之间的磁化传递，给出一组「这两个原子很近」的距离约束。把成百上千条 NOE 约束加上二面角约束喂给计算程序，可算出满足全部约束的构象系综。注意 NMR 给的天然是一组结构而非单一坐标，这恰恰反映了溶液里的构象涨落。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nmr-的独门绝技-动力学\">NMR 的独门绝技：动力学</h2><p>NMR 最不可替代的能力是测量动态，而且横跨多个时间尺度。自旋弛豫参数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、异核 NOE）报告皮秒到纳秒的快速骨架摆动；化学交换饱和转移（CEST）、弛豫弥散（CPMG）等实验则捕捉微秒到毫秒的慢速构象交换——后者恰好是酶催化循环、<a href=\"../macromolecules/structure-function\">别构</a>信号传导发生的时间尺度。</p>\n<p>这让 NMR 成为研究蛋白「呼吸」与稀有构象态的利器。它也是刻画内在无序蛋白的首选方法之一：这类蛋白在晶体里看不见、在 cryo-EM 里太小太柔，但在 NMR 里每个残基都有信号，能描绘出无序区的残余结构倾向与瞬时接触。主要限制是分子量——常规方法在约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kDa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\,\\text{kDa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kDa</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上谱线就严重重叠，需借助同位素标记与 TROSY 等技术才能上探更大体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"saxs-用散射曲线读出形状\">SAXS：用散射曲线读出形状</h2><p>小角 X 射线散射不需要结晶也不限分子量：让单色 X 射线穿过溶液样品，记录极小散射角处的强度随散射矢量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的变化。这条一维散射曲线编码了分子整体形状的信息。最直接的读数来自低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Guinier 区，按 Guinier 近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln I(q) \\approx \\ln I(0) - \\frac{R_g^2 q^2}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2732em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5872em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7731em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由曲线低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 段的斜率即可拟合出回旋半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——分子大小的稳健度量。对散射曲线做变换还能得到配对距离分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，给出最大尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与分子是球形、长条还是多结构域松散排布的判断，甚至能反演出低分辨（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>20</mn><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>A</mtext><mo>˚</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{–}20\\,\\text{Å}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.375em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˚</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）的三维分子包络。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测量</th>\n<th>从曲线何处读出</th>\n<th>给出什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>零角外推</td>\n<td>分子量与聚合状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Guinier 区斜率</td>\n<td>回旋半径（整体尺寸）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全曲线的间接傅里叶变换</td>\n<td>配对距离分布与最大尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"整合建模-把碎片拼成全景\">整合建模：把碎片拼成全景</h2><p>SAXS 单独看分辨率很低，但它和高分辨方法配合时威力惊人。一个典型场景：晶体学解出了多结构域蛋白各个结构域的高分辨结构，但它们在溶液里如何相对排布、连接区有多柔却不知道——SAXS 曲线正好约束整体形状与柔性，把刚性结构域「摆」到正确的相对位置，得到溶液态的多结构域排布。</p>\n<p>这种把不同方法的信息融进同一模型的做法叫整合/混合建模，是现代结构生物学的主流范式：晶体学/cryo-EM 给局部高分辨，NMR 给动态与约束，SAXS 给整体形状，<a href=\"../computational/md-docking\">计算模拟</a>给构象系综，质谱交联给接触对。对于<a href=\"../applications/macromolecular-machines\">大分子机器</a>这类既大又柔又动态的体系，没有单一方法能独力解决，整合建模几乎是必经之路。SAXS 也常用来快速验证 <a href=\"../computational/alphafold-prediction\">AlphaFold</a> 预测的多结构域排布是否符合溶液实测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>NMR 与 SAXS 是溶液方法，牺牲分辨率换来接近生理条件下的动态与系综信息。</li>\n<li>NMR 靠化学位移指认原子、靠 NOE 给距离约束算出构象系综，独门能力是多尺度动力学与无序区刻画。</li>\n<li>NMR 受分子量限制（常规约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kDa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\,\\text{kDa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kDa</span></span></span></span></span></span>），需同位素标记与 TROSY 上探更大体系。</li>\n<li>SAXS 不需结晶、无分子量上限，从 Guinier 区拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 得整体形状与低分辨包络。</li>\n<li>二者的真正价值在整合建模——与晶体学/cryo-EM/模拟联用拼出大而柔体系的全景，至此<a href=\"./\">结构测定方法</a>章完整，下一章转向计算预测。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核磁共振与小角散射","id":"核磁共振与小角散射"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"NMR：在磁场里听原子说话","id":"nmr-在磁场里听原子说话"},{"level":2,"text":"NMR 的独门绝技：动力学","id":"nmr-的独门绝技-动力学"},{"level":2,"text":"SAXS：用散射曲线读出形状","id":"saxs-用散射曲线读出形状"},{"level":2,"text":"整合建模：把碎片拼成全景","id":"整合建模-把碎片拼成全景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"冷冻电镜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/methods/cryo-em"},"next":{"title":"蛋白质折叠问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/structural-biology/computational/protein-folding"}}